      "category": "article",
      "title": "What’s in My Bag, 2023",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "I have never met anyone more meticulous about everyday carry than [Matt Mullenweg](https://tim.blog/2022/03/09/matt-mullenweg-antarctica/?utm_source=convertkit&utm_medium=convertkit&utm_campaign=5bf). Each year, he publishes an updated “What’s in my bag” blog post, and [this is the latest](https://ma.tt/2023/12/the-bag-post/). For a fun comparison, [see this photo](https://ma.tt/2014/08/whats-in-my-bag/) of Matt’s gadgets from nearly a decade ago.",
