    {
      "position": 4,
      "section": "Slightly healthier junk food I’ll weave into the holidays",
      "category": "other",
      "title": "Tate’s Bake Shop Ginger Zinger Cookies",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "I can easily finish an entire bag of these chewy beauties on cheat day. They are gluten-free, which I only learned after the fact. Tate’s [Chocolate Chip Cookies](https://www.amazon.com/Tates-Bake-Shop-Chocolate-Cookies/dp/B00B62W306?th=1) are also fantastic, but the Ginger Zingers are my hands-down fave. In between butter cookies and gingerbread men, I’ll have a few of these around Christmas to convince myself I’m behaving.",
      "original_url": "https://www.amazon.com/Tates-Bake-Shop-Gluten-Cookies/dp/B00MEBSRS0/",
